repository-code: "https://github.com/Rebel1487/Winzard"
url: "https://github.com/Rebel1487/Winzard"
abstract: >-
  Winzard is a free and open-source all-in-one command centre for Windows 10/11
  post-install, maintenance and customisation. It installs curated applications
  through Microsoft's official winget, applies reversible privacy and
  performance tweaks with per-item state detection, removes bloatware
  transparently, repairs the system through a 17-phase suite, and builds custom
  Windows installation images that install fully unattended. Bilingual
  (English/Spanish), portable, written entirely in PowerShell and WPF.
keywords:
  - "windows"
  - "windows-11"
  - "windows-10"
  - "winget"
